~ start
if Globals.submittedPotionType == Globals.wantedPotionType
	Herb Bert: Now that's more like it. Thanks!
else
	if Globals.submittedPotionType == "Potion Of Baldness"
		Herb Bert: Well I was meaning to go to the barber...
	elif Globals.submittedPotionType == "Potion Of Change Language"
		Herb Bert: Esto no está nada bien...
	elif Globals.submittedPotionType == "Potion of Explode"
		There was nothing left but a pile of dust.
	else
		Herb Bert: Uhhh, that wasn't right...
=> END